    <string name="tt_feature_title">Transit timetables</string>
    <string name="tt_intro">Timetables for every bus, tram, train and ferry stop in Estonia, from peatus.ee, right on OsmAnd\'s map.</string>
    <string name="tt_show_in_osmand_switch">Show timetables in OsmAnd</string>
    <string name="tt_where_hint">• Map: stops appear around the map center when it\'s in Estonia (dots from zoom 13, icons from 15). Tap one for its next departures. Configure map → the app\'s name hides them.\n• In a stop\'s menu: Next departures reloads them, Full day lists the rest of today by route.\n• Configure screen → widgets: Next departure, for the stop you last opened. Tap it for the full timetable.\n• Main menu: Transit timetables opens the search below.</string>
